@startuml
!theme materia
title SRTP Failed GPD Messages Recovery — ClouDO runbook srtp-recover-gpd-messages
actor "**Operator**\n(ClouDO UI)" as OP
participant "**ClouDO**\n(generic worker)" as CLOUDO
participant "**Runbook**\n(recover_gpd_messages.py)" as RB
database "**SRTP Key Vault**\n(cstar-itn-srtp-kv)" as KV
database "**Cosmos DB**\n(rtp_failed_messages collection)" as COSMOS
participant "**pagoPA eCommerce**\n(payment-requests-service)" as ECOM
participant "**SRTP Auth**\n(Keycloak realm srtp)" as AUTH
participant "**RTP API**\n(POST /rtp/gpd/message)" as RTP
autonumber "<b>[0]"

note over OP, CLOUDO
  Runbook **srtp-recover-gpd-messages** (partition **srtp**, require_approval: **true**)
end note

OP -> CLOUDO: run runbook
activate CLOUDO
CLOUDO -> CLOUDO: approval required
note right of CLOUDO: approver confirms the execution

CLOUDO -> RB: execute **srtp/recover_gpd_messages.py**
activate RB

RB -> KV: read secrets (ClouDO managed identity)
activate KV

alt **[KV ERROR] Secrets not readable**
  KV --[#red]> RB: error
  RB --[#red]> CLOUDO: **exit 1** (Cannot load secrets)
else **Secrets loaded**
  KV --> RB: secrets
  deactivate KV

  RB -> COSMOS: find({}) limit N
  activate COSMOS
  COSMOS --> RB: failed documents
  deactivate COSMOS
  note right of RB: sorted by message.nav, message.timestamp, _id

  alt **[NO DOCUMENTS] Collection empty**
    note right of RB: verification and RTP send not executed
    RB --> CLOUDO: **exit 0** (nothing to do)

  else **Documents found**

    loop **for each batch**
      loop **for each document**

        alt **[SEND — NO VERIFICATION] operation DELETE / UPDATE with status PAID**
          note right of RB: payment verification skipped

        else **[LEAVE] nav or ec_tax_code missing**
          note right of RB: document left in Cosmos DB for a later run

        else **Payment verification required**
          RB -> ECOM: **GET** /payment-requests/{ec_tax_code}{nav}
          activate ECOM
          note right of RB: PAYABLE / NOT_PAYABLE results cached per (nav, ec_tax_code) for the run

          alt **[200 OK] PAYABLE**
            ECOM --> RB: 200
            note right of RB: decision **SEND**

          else **[NOT_PAYABLE] 409 DUPLICATED / EXPIRED / CANCELED — 404 PAYMENT_UNKNOWN**
            ECOM --> RB: 409 / 404 + faultCodeCategory
            RB -> COSMOS: delete document (**DISCARD**, not sent to RTP)
            activate COSMOS
            COSMOS --> RB: deleted
            deactivate COSMOS

          else **[401 / 403] Subscription key rejected**
            ECOM --[#red]> RB: 401 / 403
            RB --[#red]> CLOUDO: **exit 1** (Payment verification aborted — whole run stopped)

          else **[UNCONFIRMED] other status / timeout / network error**
            ECOM --[#red]> RB: error
            deactivate ECOM
            note right of RB: decision **LEAVE**: document kept in Cosmos DB, not cached
          end
        end

        opt **decision SEND**
          RB -> AUTH: **POST** token (client_credentials)
          activate AUTH

          AUTH --> RB: access_token
          deactivate AUTH

          RB -> RTP: **POST** /rtp/gpd/message
          activate RTP

          alt **[FINAL RESPONSE] 2xx / any 4xx except 401, 403, 429**
            RTP --> RB: response
            RB -> COSMOS: delete document
            activate COSMOS
            COSMOS --> RB: deleted
            deactivate COSMOS

          else **[RETRYABLE] 5xx / 429 / 401 / 403**
            RTP --[#red]> RB: error
            deactivate RTP
            note right of RB: document kept in Cosmos DB for a later run
          end
        end

        note right of RB
          **Any other error on a document** (token request failed,
          RTP unreachable, malformed document): logged,
          document kept in Cosmos DB, processing continues
        end note

      end
    end

    RB --> CLOUDO: **exit 0** + summary
    note right of RB
      **Summary:**
      - Sent attempts
      - Deleted after send
      - Discarded (not payable)
      - Left for retry
      - Remaining in Cosmos DB
    end note
  end
end

deactivate RB
CLOUDO --> OP: execution log (stdout)
deactivate CLOUDO
@enduml
